# `flags.n3`, where Link expects one getter at the read and the code calls it itself: the lookup in front of the call asks the answers of its place, and the table that all places share stands behind a miss
# the program is made from source: its text stands at the head of the file that it is taken from
# RUN: bytes f3:Body mechanisms=all-Inlining
# CHECK-LABEL: unit f3:Body
# CHECK: GetterAtSite
# RUN(NEVER): bytes f3:Body mechanisms=all-Inlining
# NEVER-NOT: GetterByAccessTable
# RUN(ALL): bytes f3:Body mechanisms=all
# ALL-LABEL: unit f3:Body
# ALL: GetterAtSite
# RUN(WITHHELD): bytes f3:Body mechanisms=all-Guesses
# WITHHELD-NOT: GetterAtSite
# PROGRAM-OF: ../walk/guesses/getter-that-a-descriptor-lays-is-called-by-the-code-that-reads.ir
